{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:748bbc7605f3baf8285950b73afea7b753b79d5f1150a43c6b9057f301e06309",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cae06f9baa2c0b84d17aad0f96e32791e3b3b91bcf243582397e6fbe5941d79",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n是我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb4e5a579b8ca2b32c61e773a403f92f2251453c5a484aa8977f86e0cfe85a27",
      "text": "刚才我散步顺便路过事务所附近的神社时，\n被当地的居民搭话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24c19428a7b5527f933753a6ee0143a7fa87444692d497ddd73fb27becec4510",
      "text": "据说他是元旦时偶然路过了演出现场，\n从那以后就记住了我的样貌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99776ede918360fa42fc791fecee256b335f9b8a5facb241ec9547a57f2f72b5",
      "text": "那真令人高兴呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf3574519981d2a7c5b7381fea8d9b93e06fe1f951eaf9b8df83629924d35300",
      "text": "对方成为您的粉丝了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a475754e4d84dbc4f085398d81e465d9ec72881a8a4e288f0a9f6e265041fe88",
      "text": "嗯。是一件非常值得高兴的事。因此，\n我想着也要向制作人汇报一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f6d060cd2614e7dee40736eb851cffa05405244acbb569b1035156f2c881492",
      "text": "嗯。如果能通过看到我们的工作而感受到魅力，\n那就再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f1d1dc245090466d5940162f0a3b0b39e6cb4297141840c9e7f5204dd5df63",
      "text": "这是一次让我切身感受到工作成果的经历。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120eee8b70e2a6e7953e4ab46ed1d0fd1a328a43dd2e61d8a2153c1e35c861b7",
      "text": "今后也要脚踏实地累积成果，\n继续迈步向前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc2d71035bc5d6a071985794cb188673925e85a7511431d0b8d092ddb2c1a050",
      "text": "而为了达成这一点，果然也离不开你的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e680d22e673fdc984371d7bd844ee34237a5fa347ee5adba078a5db7f3825267",
      "text": "事务所的成长，与我的成长。\n还有为了你的成长，让我们一同在日常中奋进吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:035mco_401_2_4_035_01_09_a:2_4_035_01_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5bb0d1409c3580790a30f4075ed31c889a0cb585aaed5d8a2234cc97d40d777",
      "text": "明天起也继续拜托你了。\n那么，失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
